WEBVTT

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:15.030
<i>DOKI - Chihiro</i>

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:15.030
<i>DOKI</i>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>fukigenna tenki moyou ga nori utsutteta aitsu</b>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>不機嫌な天気模様が乗り移ってたアイツ</b>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>That fellow was affected by bad weather</b>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.040
<b>nanda! chotto naname ni sora wo miteta dake ka</b>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.040
<b>なんだ！　ちょっとナナメに空を見てただけか</b>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.040
<b>What! He's only squinting at the sky</b>

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.630
<b>shiritai (misetai)</b>

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.630
<b>知りたい（見せたい）</b>

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.630
<b>I want to know (I want to see)</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.210
<b>wakaritai (wakaranai)</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.210
<b>解りたい（解らない）</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.210
<b>I want to understand (I can't understand)</b>

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>nakitai (nakenai)</b>

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>泣きたい（泣けない）</b>

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>I want to cry (I can't cry)</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>soredemo</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>それでも</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>Even so,</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>shikatanai (kubomanai)</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>仕方ない（凹まない）</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>It can't be helped (Not feeling depressed)</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>itakunai (youkumonai)</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>痛くない（痒くもない）</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>It doesn't hurt (It doesn't itch)</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>kowashitai (kowaretai)</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>壊したい（壊れたい）</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>I want to break (I want to be broken)</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>yuzurenai omoi nara</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>譲れない思いなら</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>I don't want to surrender these feelings</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>chiratsuku kiiro shingou mushishite</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>ちらつく黄色信号　無視して</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>Just ignore that flashing yellow signal</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>kou kakudo de joushou chuu kokoro no flying saucer</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>高角度で上昇中　心のflying saucer</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>The flying saucer in my heart is rising at a sharp angle</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>nakanaka sunao ni nan nai himitsu no tobira ni keri irete!</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>なかなか素直になんない秘密のトビラに蹴り入れて！</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>It kicks open that dishonest, secret door</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>chuugaeri de mata modotte kuru yo</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>宙返りでまた戻ってくるよ</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>Do a loop-the-loop and return once more {Loop-the-Loop is the title of this song}</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>sakaraenai jiryoku mitai na omoi yo todoke!</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>逆らえない磁力みたいな思いよ　届け！</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>Convey those seemingly irresistable magnetic feelings to you!</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>omote no kādo de shoubu shinai nande</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>表のカードで勝負しないなんで</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>You can't use a face card to decide the victory.</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>dare no tame no moraru?</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:36.400
Motto To LOVE-Ru 13

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:36.400
<u>The Queen of Love</u>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.990
Good morning, Saki-sama.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.240
Morning...

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:57.510
No matter if I am asleep or awake, I'm always thinking about that guy.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.430
This is troublesome, isn't it?

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.600
I'm sorry, Miss. {@ Kanade: How did we TL ojou-sama previously?}{Not sure, let Holo decide. I prefer Ojou-sama}

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:06.430
Geez...

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.440
That's why I didn't want to use the minor roads. {TLC: shitamachi no michi/ downtown implying that they're poorer or something?}{It means the smaller roads that gave gutter plates}

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.860
What's the matter?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.480
The tire is stuck.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.860
Let me see...

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.580
It's fine like this, right?

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.500
Why have you appeared before me? {TLC: show up?}

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.390
I am this troubled inside... {TLC}

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:47.310
Why on earth is my heart beating like this?

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.440
Saki-sama...

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.480
She's this infatuated with that guy... {TLC}

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.400
Rito!

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.200
Rito?

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.240
How strange...

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.910
Where did he go?

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.950
And I specially made this bento for him too...

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.540
Stop joking around!

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.540
You want me to eat that?!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.250
Black stuff is coming out of it too...

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:18.300
I made this because I heard that guys loved handmade bentos...

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.680
Who the hell told Lala that...

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.050
Oh yeah, in the end, they all went in.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.140
No way!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.560
<b>It was these two people</b>

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.560
<b>It was these two people</b>

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.730
Rito!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.560
Where are you?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.060
Even though I feel bad for Lala,

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.520
Rito!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.520
I need to hide from her for a while.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.620
Um...

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.870
Aren't you two always with Tenjouin-senpai?

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.080
I'm Kujou Rin.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.170
This is Fujisaki Aya.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:59.920
For now... I hope you'll untie this rope...

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:01.760
If we didn't do that...

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:05.470
Who knows what a beast like you would do if you were free... {TLC}

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.760
That's what you think of me?!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.430
Don't worry.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:13.270
All you need to do is accept our request, and then we'll let you go. {TLC}

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.100
Request?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.650
It's about Zastin-sama.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.520
Zastin?

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:22.240
I hope you can get Tenjouin-sama's beloved Zastin-sama to come to school,

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.410
and give her a chance to confess.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.370
B-Beloved?!

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.330
Tenjouin-senpai likes Zastin?!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.830
It's like that?!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.410
Your reply?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.290
Hello?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.920
Oh, it's Rito-dono.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.840
What? Come to school immediately?

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.880
Zastin will be coming soon.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:45.930
Yay!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.640
I'm going to tell Saki-sama!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.770
Sorry for using such a forceful method. {TLC}

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:55.350
Thanks.

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:01.150
But why would you go this far for Tenjouin-senpai?

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:06.110
My family has served the Tenjouins for generations. {TLC}

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:07.780
Doing this is natural. {TLC}

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.160
However, it's not only that.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.540
She is very kind.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.420
Aya used to get bullied a lot.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.180
That bunch are picking on people again. {TLC}

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.090
Saki-sama.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.010
Maybe it's best if we didn't get involved. {TLC}

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.930
I can't allow them to continue.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.890
Stop this!

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.940
If you carry on,

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:41.270
then I, Tenjouin Saki, the queen of battles, will take you on! {TLC: Queen of fighting?}

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.030
Since then...

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.410
Aya has always followed Saki-sama. {TLC}

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:49.780
So it's like that...

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.660
I didn't expect that...

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.870
...she{Saki} would do something like that.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.300
Rito-dono was the one who called me here...

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.300
But what am I supposed to do?

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.300
Saki-sama! Here's your chance!

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.470
B-But I'm not prepared yet!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.730
Go! Meet him!

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.860
U-Um...

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:25.610
You are...

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.450
I-I'm Tenjouin Saki.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.620
Is there something you need from me?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.120
Um...

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.750
I... um...

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.380
Um...

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.510
Do your best, Saki-sama!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.640
This is making me nervous too!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.100
Rito!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.270
So you're here!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.680
Here. Ah~

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:03.690
This is made from special ingredients from Deviluke! {TLC}

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.730
Is it tasty?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.820
Um... I-

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:14.410
Saki-sama!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.580
You again!?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.330
Why do you always... always... always...?!

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.050
Rito!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.800
Eh? Zastin?

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.980
I did not see anything.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.110
How dare you embarrass me in front of him!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.990
Wait!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:15.550
Motto To LOVE-Ru 14

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:15.550
<u>Let's Play</u>

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:14.180
Hello! Delivery! {TLC: something about silver river?}

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:18.430
Run-san, the item that you ordered has arrived!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.430
<b>Run & Ren
A space vessel from their planet</b>

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.140
It's finally here.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.230
All right, come out...

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.730
A rarity across the universe, the Youth Skunk!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.740
I'll explain.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:38.700
This animal emits a gas from its rear-end, which will transform any living thing into a child...

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:42.540
I'll use this to turn Lala back into a child.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.290
If she's a child, then her powers will diminish by half.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.790
Getting my year long revenge will be easy. {TLC}

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.000
All right, come...

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.680
Good morning...

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.730
What? Is she lost?

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.270
Eh? That kid...

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.150
Isn't she Run-chan?

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.190
Rito-kun...

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:15.070
The skunk's gas turned you into a child?!

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.240
How can that be?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.160
Why would you have such a suspicious animal...

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:25.250
Um... It looked really cute in the catalogue...

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:28.210
So, Run-chan... Where's the skunk?

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.920
It ran away.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.960
What?!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:35.420
Lala! What will happen if we can't find it?

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.260
Ah!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.260
Maybe it's that?

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:44.430
All right! I'll catch it!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.100
Wait!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.450
I got turned into a kid too!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.200
Lala...

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.490
Oh crap!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.820
It's going inside the school!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:04.160
Damn. Now it's come to this, I'll have to catch it!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.080
Rito-kun!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.000
How could I have caused trouble for Rito-kun...

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.590
Ah! How cute!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.840
Where did you come from?

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.260
Where is your father and mother?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.470
What's the matter, Sairenji-san?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.560
Check this out too, Kotegawa-san! It's so cute!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:34.650
Honestly... who could have brought such a pet... to... school.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.950
It really is cute...

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:41.910
Right?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.120
Kotegawa!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.790
Don't go near that thing!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.920
K-Kotegawa-san?!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:58.470
Yuuki-kun! This is one of your tricks again!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.260
This time, I'm going to make you pay for this!

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.050
Sorry! I don't have time right now.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.100
I'm sorry, Sairenji! I'll leave Kotegawa in your care!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.060
You can't ignore Yui! {TLC}

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.360
There, there!

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.650
Hey...

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:21.360
Haven't they grown bigger again?

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.160
Eh? She's become flat-chested!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.080
That voice belongs to Honegawa-sensei! {TLC: Did i guess that name right?}

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.540
Eh? What happened to me...

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.790
Who are you?!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.380
Yami-chuan! {He does say chuan lol}

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.260
Can you give me your gym clothes from a few days ago? {TLC}

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:42.260
Preferably unwashed... {TLC}

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.310
She's so cute that I want to give her a hug! {TLC}

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:55.610
Everyone! Come gather over here!

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:59.780
Damn! If this continues, the school will turn into a nursery!{high school of the babies -masat}

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.820
What should I do... This is all my fault...

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:10.910
So you're over there... All right.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.220
Yay! I caught it!

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.100
Run-chan! Are you all right?

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.190
Lala-chan...

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.230
I'll pull you up now!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.740
Lala-chan came to save me...

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:47.200
And I was thinking about doing mean things to her...

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.700
Sorry, Lala-chan.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.200
I was wrong...

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.960
All right!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.260
Gotcha!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.880
Sorry!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.890
I couldn't control my strength because I got turned into a child! {TLC}

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.270
I hate you after all!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.230
How much longer will they stay kids?

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.940
The effects of the gas will wear off soon.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:31.410
Motto To LOVE-Ru 15

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:31.410
<u>The flavour of chocolate is a sweet sensation</u>

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.700
This time of year is pretty tough. {TLC: period?}{season}

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:35.750
We have to give the boys chocolate. {TLC}

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:40.130
But working hard making them is important for girls.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.300
Chocolate?

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.470
Ah... It's Valentine's Day.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:50.720
Hey Kotegawa-san, maybe you're interested in Valentine's Day too? {TLC}

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.680
Oh! Yui finally has someone she likes?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.520
Hey, who are you going to give it to?

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:57.690
Eh?

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.820
Why did Yuuki-kun suddenly appear in my mind?!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:05.610
I have no interest in shameless things like that.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.360
Oh.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.950
Geez... As usual, you can't joke around with her. {TLC}

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.500
Valentine's... huh?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.090
W-Why do I need to hide?

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:26.300
Hey Rito. It's almost Valentine's!

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:29.050
My heart is beating fast!

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.180
Beating fast?

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.220
Wait, Saruyama-kun!

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.890
Um... This...

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.100
Please accept it!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.230
Thank you, Riko-chan.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.490
But I'd...{split these -masat}

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.240
...prefer you... instead of chocolate... {TLC}{split these -masat}

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.660
Saruyama-kun!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.500
If it's like that...

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.750
So that's what you're imagining in your head?

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.210
But I wouldn't get my hopes up for something like that. {TLC}

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.670
As long as I get chocolates from a girl...

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.050
Whether it's for friendship or not, I'll still be happy!{giri chocolate, chocolate given as friendship and not from love}

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.510
You're right.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.720
As for you, Rito, you'll be fine.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.350
Me?

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.890
At the very least, you'll get chocolate from Lala-chan and Mikan-chan.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.310
I don't want to see you anymore!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.400
Go home! Disappear! You bastard!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.940
Wait, what you are on about?

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:29.320
So receiving chocolates can make you this happy.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.320
I don't get you at all!

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.070
[Sainan Shopping District]

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:38.040
How cute!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.200
That one!

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.000
Which one should I pick?

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.210
I'm back.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:54.260
Um... First, you melt the chocolate...

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.680
How long should I heat it for?

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.020
Hey! You're working hard!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.310
Eh?! Onii-chan!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.150
What do you want?

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.440
You're giving it to that Yuuki, right?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.650
What are you getting the wrong idea about?!

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.150
Why do I have to give anything to Yuuki-kun-

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:15.740
I'm only trying to make some chocolate for him as a friend. {TLC}

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.660
What a transparent little sister. {TLC}

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:20.500
Geez... Go outside. You're in the way.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.080
All right.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.670
Good luck!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:32.050
Even if he's only getting a friendship chocolate, he'll be very happy.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.970
Onii-chan.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.980
All right. It's done.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.850
Even though I had to restart a few times, but like this... {TLC}

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:50.110
Yuuki-kun will be very happy.

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:52.900
I'm like an idiot!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.820
It's only for friendship. Friendship chocolate!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.700
Afterwards, I'll wrap it up and give it to him.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:00.450
Give it to him?

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:01.540
Oh yeah.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.120
I still have to give it to him...

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.620
I never thought about that.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.420
How am I going to give it to Yuuki-kun?!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.140
Hey, Rito!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.970
What's up?

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.180
You're so excited this early in the morning.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.520
Of course! Have a look...

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:32.360
Everyone is worried about whether they'll get chocolates today, no matter who they are.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.570
Hey! Saruyama and Yuuki! For you!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.200
They're friendship chocolates.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.370
Thank you!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.450
For you, Saruyama.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.160
Your first and last chocolate.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.040
What did you say?!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.670
They gave it to them so easily.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:49.540
That's right. That's all I have to do. {TLC}

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.460
Yuuki-kun!

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.720
Kotegawa.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.340
U-Um...

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.430
T-This...

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:03.350
Val...{I'd make all the stuttering into one line -masat}

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.230
Val? Val what?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.190
Val...

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.690
Idiot!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:13.860
[Valentine (BARENTAIN) and Idiot (BAKA) both starts with BA]

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:18.110
Did I do something?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:28.000
I never thought that giving chocolates would be this difficult.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.500
I didn't think it'd be like this.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:36.420
Yuuki-kun and Kotegawa-san, since you two are on duty, please take these to the staff room.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.260
All right. This time...

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:48.310
Why am I this nervous?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.360
Yuuki-kun!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:56.820
U-Um...

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.780
I'm sorry!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.820
W-What are you doing?

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:04.530
That's because... you're angry, right?

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.290
Why would I be?!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.620
Rito-kun!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.420
What?!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.750
I feel like giving you Valentine chocolates.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.260
Here. Take it.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:32.690
How shameless!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.650
I'm sorry!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.990
Geez, that's enough! That guy.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:42.280
Anyway, why do I have to give him chocolates?! {TLC}

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.530
Rito!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:44.870
Here! Take this.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:48.240
I made it with Haruna. It's a special chocolate!

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:49.040
Thank you!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.830
We made it together in Haruna's house yesterday!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:55.040
Lala-san worked hard!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.420
Thanks! Lala, Sairenji!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:15.610
What a surprise.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.650
I never thought Lala and Haruna-chan would...

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.860
Yuuki-kun!

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.540
This...

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.380
...is for you.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.880
Is that chocolate by any chance?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.800
You're giving it to me?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.590
I'll make this clear. It's a friendship chocolate!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.720
Because in the end, we're just friends! {TLC}

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.810
I'm saying something unnecessary again...

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.730
Geez... Why do I always end up doing this...

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.690
I'm really happy!

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.860
Thanks, Kotegawa!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.990
You really surprised me.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.950
You said that I was your friend....

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.080
To be honest, I thought you always hated me.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:11.290
He seems really happy.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.450
I'm really happy! Thanks.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.250
I'm glad I gave it to him.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.130
I'm back.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.710
Oh. Welcome home!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.510
Rito! I have chocolates for you.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:26.380
Thank you.

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.720
They're chocolates! You also got these?

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:33.600
This is like a dream...

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:35.690
From Haruna-san and Lala-san?

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.850
No, this is from Kotegawa.

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:39.690
Kotegawa-san gave one to you too?

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:40.480
Yeah.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.190
Well, it's only for friendship.

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:53.200
Friendship eh?

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.620
Eh? What?

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:57.670
Nothing...

00:21:58.460 --> 00:21:59.920
...at all~

